e the environment.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le07ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "There has never been a better time to start caring for the environment, has there? Is that not what scientists are saying? With the increasing number of cars, factories, and even people, the environment is in danger. Obviously we have not been doing what we were supposed to be doing or there wouldn't be a crisis!", "id": 1}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "We were supposed to recycle. You haven't been neglecting this, have you?  Recycling paper saves trees. Is that not what we all want?  When you wipe up the kitchen, use a washable cloth instead of paper towels. You don't need to throw away more and more paper, do you? You were supposed to take all of your recyclables out of the weekly trash, too! You did that, right?\n<br/>\nAren't you unhappy about adding more chemicals to our water supply? If you wanted to make an effective cleaner to wash counters and floors, you could mix vinegar, water and a tiny bit of dish soap. Don't forget you were going to put it in a refillable plastic bottle as well! There will be less plastic to recycle!", "id": 2}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "Another thing we were all supposed to be doing to help the environment was not litter. Isn't that what we have all been taught? Unfortunately, litter has been piling up in our cities and natural areas. We should remind other people not to litter too. Can they not see why it's important?<br/>\nFinally your car. You were going to spend less time driving and more time walking. You have, haven't you?", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "text": "There has never been a better time to start caring for the environment, has there? Is that not what scientists are saying? With the increasing number of cars, factories, and even people, the environment is in danger. Obviously we have not been doing what we were supposed to be doing or there wouldn't be a crisis!", "id": 1}, {"time": "19200", "image": "", "text": "We were supposed to recycle. You haven't been neglecting this, have you? Recycling paper saves trees. Is that not what we all want? When you wipe up the kitchen, use a washable cloth instead of paper towels. You don't need to throw away more and more paper, do you? You were supposed to take all of your recyclables out of the weekly trash, too! You did that, right?\nAren't you unhappy about adding more chemicals to our water supply? If you wanted to make an effective cleaner to wash counters and floors, you could mix vinegar, water and a tiny bit of dish soap. Don't forget you were going to put it in a refillable plastic bottle as well! There will be less plastic to recycle!", "id": 2}, {"time": "65000", "image": "", "text": "Another thing we were all supposed to be doing to help the environment was not litter. Isn't that what we have all been taught? Unfortunately, litter has been piling up in our cities and natural areas. We should remind other people not to litter too. Can they not see why it's important?\nFinally your car. You were going to spend less time driving and more time walking. You have, haven't you?", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le07ob10re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}